      "findings": [
        {
          "source_quote": "ἵνα ἕκαστος, ἐπιδικαζόμενος τοῦ πάντας φίλους ἔχειν, αὐτὸν διαλλάττων σώζηται",
          "english_quote": "so that each person, pressing his claim to have everyone as friends, may be saved by reconciling him",
          "issue": "The English preserves the active construction with αὐτόν as its object, but the identity of ἕκαστος, the referent of αὐτόν, and the relationship effected by διαλλάττων remain unresolved. The existing note discloses the uncertainty and marks it as publication-blocking. Adequate disclosure does not supply the separate evidence needed to resolve that hold. This is a source-meaning problem, not demonstrated corruption of the verified print.",
          "suggested_revision": "Retain the provisional wording and disclosure. Obtain a separate contextual and lexical assessment of ἐπιδικάζομαι with the genitive infinitival expression and of active διαλλάττω with a personal object and an unstated second party, supported by cited Greek usage. Do not insert a named referent or change the construction to self-reconciliation without that evidence. Any resulting replacement requires fresh review.",
          "severity": "blocking"
        },
        {
          "source_quote": "τῆς αὐτοῦ ἐπακούων ὁμιλίας",
          "english_quote": "and heeding his discourse.",
          "issue": "The possessive αὐτοῦ most naturally refers to the presiding leader, but its relationship to the unresolved preceding αὐτόν remains uncertain. The draft preserves the pronoun and discloses the alternative; it does not establish whose discourse is heeded. This separately disclosed blocking issue cannot be cleared merely by retaining neutral English.",
          "suggested_revision": "Provide a separate antecedent analysis using the supplied paragraph, including the recurring references to the leader and the preceding reconciliation clause. Preserve the alternative if the evidence remains inconclusive. No correction to the Greek is presently justified, and the passage remains blocked.",
          "severity": "blocking"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "reference": "19",
